1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:06,285
UNK zogt az du host geven in a lager in PoylnD, un nokh dem

2
00:00:06,285 --> 00:00:07,720
vos hot geshen?

3
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:11,109
dos iz geven in velkhe yor? velkhe yor?

4
00:00:10,963 --> 00:00:14,214
dos iz geven in toyznt nayn hundert

5
00:00:13,625 --> 00:00:14,625
yo?

6
00:00:14,743 --> 00:00:17,420
I fertsik tsveytn yor.

7
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,300
⟨⟩.

8
00:00:17,798 --> 00:00:24,550
dos iz geven in SENTYABR' khoydesh. shoyn dergangen tsu SENTYABR' khoydesh, vu...

9
00:00:24,919 --> 00:00:30,617
un efsher ken zayn, ershte teg OKTYABRYA, OKTYABR' khoydesh, oktober,

10
00:00:31,163 --> 00:00:36,040
nor, genoy iz shver tsu gedenken teg.

11
00:00:36,681 --> 00:00:42,260
nor ikh bin avekgegangen ahin o avuhin er hot mir gezogt, zol ikh geyn

12
00:00:42,503 --> 00:00:44,404
shteln zikh in rey,

13
00:00:44,950 --> 00:00:50,120
kedey me vet undz, kedey ikh zol avekforn

14
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:54,005
mit di vos fo- me firt aveket in GERMANIYA.

15
00:00:54,703 --> 00:01:02,125
bin ikh gegangen mit der veg vi dan a toyter kimat vi bin ikh

16
00:01:02,125 --> 00:01:04,142
derpoyzet tsum lazaret.

17
00:01:04,142 --> 00:01:06,055
azoy hot er mir geheysn geyn,

18
00:01:06,702 --> 00:01:11,069
kh'zol nit geyn in mitn lager, azoy geyn. s'iz geven nokh tunkl,

19
00:01:11,069 --> 00:01:16,550
un ikh bin dergangen bizl, tever fun aroysgeyn

20
00:01:16,641 --> 00:01:19,800
fun lager, bizl der komendature.

21
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:21,422
dortn iz shoyn geshtanen

22
00:01:21,422 --> 00:01:23,166
der zekster blok,

23
00:01:23,188 --> 00:01:26,304
fun di pravoslavne, fun di rusn.

24
00:01:26,901 --> 00:01:30,607
ot. un yener b-, di NATSMENer

25
00:01:31,305 --> 00:01:38,240
zaynen dernokh dem untergegangen. bin ikh tsugegangen tsu dem blokovn

26
00:01:38,983 --> 00:01:40,884
un ikh hob zikh forgeshtelt.

27
00:01:42,105 --> 00:01:46,480
hot er a ruf geton, MELKONYANen

28
00:01:48,838 --> 00:01:52,510
un zogt, "shtel im aveket lebn zikh."

29
00:01:52,922 --> 00:01:55,700
mir tsu ⟨zeye⟩re.

30
00:01:55,700 --> 00:01:58,839
MELKONYAN hot mir derzen, BUBUSHYAN hot mir derzen.

31
00:01:58,862 --> 00:02:01,800
zey hobn gemeynt az ikh bin shoyn a gehargeter,

32
00:02:02,608 --> 00:02:05,750
vorem far vos iz? er zogt...

33
00:02:05,933 --> 00:02:12,870
zey zaynen geven avek shp- shpatsirn az m'hot mir a ruf geton, der vakh-man

34
00:02:12,953 --> 00:02:15,647
zaynen zey geven avekgegangen shpatsirn,

35
00:02:16,311 --> 00:02:20,090
hobn zey nit gevust. dernokh dem zeen ze az ikh bin farfaln gevorn,

36
00:02:20,090 --> 00:02:23,500
hot men zey gezogt az mir hot a vakh-man tsugenumen

37
00:02:23,500 --> 00:02:26,600
un hot avekgefirt in komendature; oyf kerik bin ikh nit gekumen.

38
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:29,720
zey flegn oft, nemen mentshn.

39
00:02:29,862 --> 00:02:35,256
me flegt imetsn masern, flegn zey oft nemen mentshn, me fleg zey durkhkukn un fleg zey aroyslozn kerik,

40
00:02:35,346 --> 00:02:39,470
⟨vayle flegt⟩ zikh, zayn nit keyn yid. farshteyst?

41
00:02:39,835 --> 00:02:43,333
kurts geredt, ikh bin, zog ikh tsu im azoy: "her,

42
00:02:43,333 --> 00:02:44,908
 ikh hob dir lang gezogt

43
00:02:45,555 --> 00:02:49,211
az bay mir iz tutvey geven der boykh. kh'hob dir gezogt?"...

44
00:02:49,892 --> 00:02:54,980
neyn, im zog ikh. ikh zog tsu MELKONYANen...

45
00:02:54,980 --> 00:02:57,142
"bay mir iz der boykh geven tutvey."

46
00:02:57,688 --> 00:02:59,960
zogt er, "bay dir dokh tseyner feln!"

47
00:03:01,047 --> 00:03:02,340
er zogt tsu mir.

48
00:03:02,683 --> 00:03:04,499
"avu iz dayne tseyner?"

49
00:03:08,083 --> 00:03:09,899
zog ikh, "bay mir iz TSINGA.

50
00:03:10,412 --> 00:03:13,650
du veyst nit, bay mir iz TSINGA a strashne.

51
00:03:13,650 --> 00:03:16,163
kh'bin avek mitn boykh, di tseyner ⟨oyf⟩gekhapt,

52
00:03:16,163 --> 00:03:18,556
mit di finger aroysgeshlept der dokter.

53
00:03:19,288 --> 00:03:22,859
mit di finger!" s'iz take gegangen TSINGA dortn in lager.

54
00:03:23,119 --> 00:03:29,530
flegt men undz gebn trinken... nit undz alemen; in dos, in lazaret flegt men gebn trinken,

55
00:03:29,532 --> 00:03:33,609
fun dos o, sosne. faran aza boym, sosne, shtekhelekh,

56
00:03:33,700 --> 00:03:36,158
flegt men dos kokhn un gebn trinken.

57
00:03:36,265 --> 00:03:37,929
kurts geredt, kh'hob zikh o⟨p⟩geredt.

58
00:03:38,053 --> 00:03:39,940
"ikh bin geven," zog ikh, "in lazaret.

59
00:03:39,940 --> 00:03:42,249
m'hot mir gemasert az ikh bin a yid.

60
00:03:42,255 --> 00:03:44,966
dir hot men dokh eyn mol oykhet gemasert," zog ikh tsu im.

61
00:03:45,107 --> 00:03:47,450
"mir hot men gemasert. bin ikh avek...

62
00:03:47,450 --> 00:03:49,387
du veyst dokh, zey voltn mir nit aroyslozn.

63
00:03:50,119 --> 00:03:55,819
bin ikh a- geven dortn o. m'hot derzen az ikh bin nit keyn yid, hot men mir, opgelozn. bin ikh avek," zog ikh,

64
00:03:55,819 --> 00:03:57,960
"in, lazaret.

65
00:03:58,928 --> 00:04:01,774
vos der moyl tut vey veyst dokh oykhet bay mir geven."

66
00:04:02,758 --> 00:04:07,257
ot azoy, er hot dos tsugenumen far a, az s'iz azoy geven,

67
00:04:07,990 --> 00:04:10,312
un me hot undz gefirt

68
00:04:10,622 --> 00:04:12,104
bay a vokh tsayt.

69
00:04:12,104 --> 00:04:17,124
iber hoypt flegt men araynhakn in TUPIK flegt men a-... a TUPIK ruft zikh dos,

70
00:04:17,124 --> 00:04:20,605
avu me shtelt avek dem p-, poyezd, dem, ban...

71
00:04:20,916 --> 00:04:25,191
un me lozt durkh ale POYAZDn, ale banen, di NEM- doytshishe

72
00:04:25,191 --> 00:04:28,818
flegt men durkhlozn oyfn front mit gever,

73
00:04:28,818 --> 00:04:31,820
mit soldatn. fun front flegt men firn ge-

74
00:04:31,820 --> 00:04:35,422
 geroybte zakhn vos zey flegn onroybn,

75
00:04:35,766 --> 00:04:44,282
un zey flegn firn, geroybte, altsenesding vos zey flegn khapn in zeyere hent, afile yidishe kleyder oykhet, yidishe guts.

76
00:04:44,305 --> 00:04:46,343
alts flegt men firn in GERMANIYA.

77
00:04:46,343 --> 00:04:49,507
un gevundete, un farvundete flegt men firn zeyere.

78
00:04:49,507 --> 00:04:51,870
iz dos, flegt men dos alts durkhlozn. ⟨k-⟩

79
00:04:51,870 --> 00:04:56,854
kitser, iber a vokh tsayt hot men undz gebrakht in sh- in, in a shtot LUDWIGSBURG.

80
00:04:56,927 --> 00:04:58,305
dos iz GERMANIYA,

81
00:04:58,362 --> 00:05:00,971
in, in, mitn GERMANIYA.

82
00:05:01,011 --> 00:05:03,333
in LUDWIGSBURG hot men oykhet

83
00:05:03,913 --> 00:05:05,999
durkhgelozn undz durkh a bod.

84
00:05:06,833 --> 00:05:12,227
m'iz oykh gegangen dortn shoyn, tsu fertsik man hot men gelozn durkhn bod.

85
00:05:12,537 --> 00:05:15,062
ikh hob farshtanen az zey zukhn do yidn.

86
00:05:15,085 --> 00:05:17,458
ikh hob farshtanen az do iz mayn sof.

87
00:05:17,582 --> 00:05:21,190
oyb zey hobn dortn shtark gezukht, iz do in l- in zeyer,

88
00:05:21,190 --> 00:05:26,233
in zeyer volfisher, PONIMAESH', nore, vet men gevis zukhn yidn.

89
00:05:27,437 --> 00:05:29,422
nor ikh hob zikh zeyer geven

90
00:05:30,525 --> 00:05:35,860
ge- bavundert az in bod hot men mir, ⟨, hot⟩ men nit gezukht keyn yidn.

91
00:05:36,668 --> 00:05:41,049
me hot di zakhn undzere oysgesmalyet, s'zol nit zayn keyn floyen.

92
00:05:41,393 --> 00:05:45,994
me hot durkhgelozn durkhn bod OTDEL'Ne. m'hot undz gegebn hiltsene shikh.

93
00:05:46,843 --> 00:05:50,195
ot di vos iz shoyn geven hot men bay undz tsugenumen.

94
00:05:50,539 --> 00:05:52,254
m'hot gegebn hiltsene.

95
00:05:54,066 --> 00:05:56,712
ongedreyt oyf zey di onitses

96
00:05:56,712 --> 00:05:58,616
un dernokh dem arayngerukt di shikh,

97
00:05:58,622 --> 00:06:00,894
in di, in di hiltsene shikh,

98
00:06:01,035 --> 00:06:03,746
KOLODKI. UNK gerufn KOLODKI.

99
00:06:03,769 --> 00:06:05,332
az mir flegn geyn,

100
00:06:05,676 --> 00:06:07,205
iz flegt zikh klapn.

101
00:06:07,431 --> 00:06:10,665
ot do hobn zey shoyn undz ale tog getribn oyf arbet.

102
00:06:11,110 --> 00:06:13,011
shoyn ongekumen di kelt.

103
00:06:13,388 --> 00:06:19,110
s'iz geven, tsvey blokn iz geven in eyn OTSEK fun PROVOLke. s'iz geven a sakh blokn,

104
00:06:19,311 --> 00:06:20,632
⟨oyf⟩ a sakh geven,

105
00:06:20,632 --> 00:06:22,350
nor tsu tsvey OTSEKn,

106
00:06:22,382 --> 00:06:27,120
tsu tsvey blokn iz geven in an OTSEK, az mir hobn nit gekent arayngeyn in an ander OTSEK,

107
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:30,290
nor di tsvey blokn hobn gekent eyne tsu di andere geyn.

108
00:06:31,005 --> 00:06:33,830
un a VYSHKe iz geven fun hintn.

109
00:06:33,830 --> 00:06:38,002
s'iz geven a sakh VYSHKes, nor, hinter undzer, blok a VYSHKe.

110
00:06:39,156 --> 00:06:42,640
in mitn, hoyf iz geshtanen a stolb.

111
00:06:42,953 --> 00:06:49,860
mir hobn gornit oyf im nit ge- akhtung gegebn: s'shteyt a stolb, s'shteyt a stolb ayngegrobn.,

112
00:06:50,783 --> 00:06:54,337
oyf arbet flegt men, dos iz geven vinter, ikh hob zikh farkilt,

113
00:06:54,445 --> 00:06:59,130
mit a temperatur, nor blaybn hobn ikh nit getort in blok.

114
00:06:59,130 --> 00:07:01,950
me hot, glaykh shikt men dir in,

115
00:07:01,950 --> 00:07:04,397
in dos o, tsum,

116
00:07:04,397 --> 00:07:06,082
 in lazaret.

117
00:07:06,679 --> 00:07:09,255
in lazaret ken men a kuk ton ver ikh bin.

118
00:07:10,527 --> 00:07:16,560
farshteyst? un do oyb me arbet, ken shoyn a doytshisher doktor oykh a kuk ton, tsi ikh bin nit keyn SIMULYANT.

119
00:07:17,428 --> 00:07:20,870
farshteyst? iz fleg ikh geyn oyf arbet

120
00:07:20,870 --> 00:07:22,788
mit a groyser temperatur.

121
00:07:23,132 --> 00:07:26,467
ikh bin geven a ayngemidter. me hot undz getribn oyf arbet oyf,

122
00:07:26,524 --> 00:07:29,420
s'iz geven a KAR'ER, hobn mir gedarft di shteyner...

123
00:07:30,220 --> 00:07:31,668
me flegt oyfraysn.

124
00:07:31,668 --> 00:07:35,749
geven a NEMETS, mir flegn makhn lekher mit dreln,

125
00:07:36,126 --> 00:07:39,697
flegt er araynrukn ahin azelkhe lange shashkes

126
00:07:40,058 --> 00:07:46,270
TOL, un flegt, un mir flegn opgeyn un er, un er flegt oyfraysn zey,

127
00:07:46,673 --> 00:07:48,821
flegt brenen a shnur oyfraysn.

128
00:07:48,821 --> 00:07:50,719
falt zikh fanander di shteyner,

129
00:07:50,719 --> 00:07:52,724
darfn mir mit hamers tseklapn.

130
00:07:52,933 --> 00:07:58,530
dernokh dem oyf azelkhe NOSILKes... ruft zikh NOSILKes oyf goyish, oyf rusish:

131
00:07:58,530 --> 00:08:02,830
es geyt tsvey palkes un do breter tsugeklapt,

132
00:08:02,830 --> 00:08:08,170
un oyf der heykh flegn mir avekleygn, dortn o di shteyner di fanandergeklapte

133
00:08:08,170 --> 00:08:13,650
un tsutrogn tsu der mashin velkhe klapt fanander oyf, kleyne shteyndlekh.

134
00:08:14,027 --> 00:08:16,810
iz flegn mir ot oyf aza arbet. di arbet iz

135
00:08:16,810 --> 00:08:21,466
VRODE nemt zikh, iz VRODE nit azoy, ETO far a gezuntn mentshn,

136
00:08:21,466 --> 00:08:24,807
nor ⟨az s'iz shoyn, az s'iz⟩ oysgevept der, der koyekh,

137
00:08:24,807 --> 00:08:28,179
iz fleg ikh kumen far nakht kam a lebediker.

138
00:08:28,708 --> 00:08:31,807
iz in eyn mo- in eynem a tog in a vinter,

139
00:08:32,134 --> 00:08:38,017
nokh aza min arbet, az m'hot undz gebrakht tsu traybn... mir hobn gearbet tsu fertsn, zekhtsn sho...

140
00:08:38,091 --> 00:08:40,160
az m'hot undz gebrakht tsu traybn,

141
00:08:40,538 --> 00:08:43,417
iz hobn mir derzen a shreklekhe zakh.

142
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:48,460
s'iz geven a shney shoyn, a frost.

143
00:08:48,537 --> 00:08:52,710
iz geven in dem s- tsum stolb,

144
00:08:52,755 --> 00:08:56,520
geven mit shtekh-drot... oto.

145
00:08:57,126 --> 00:09:00,510
mit azelkhe drot. dos iz shtekh-drot.

146
00:09:00,703 --> 00:09:02,401
mit oto di drot

147
00:09:02,593 --> 00:09:05,759
iz geven er a hoyler yat,

148
00:09:05,766 --> 00:09:10,330
a hoyler, a yunger yat UNK a sheyner, a yunger

149
00:09:10,710 --> 00:09:12,982
ayngedreyt in di drot.

150
00:09:13,073 --> 00:09:15,530
di kop iz bay im ot azoy aropgelozn shoyn.

151
00:09:17,106 --> 00:09:20,080
er geyt shoyn oys. oyfn

152
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:22,753
haldz hengt bay im a F- a FANERe,

153
00:09:22,945 --> 00:09:24,424
aza min bretl,

154
00:09:25,330 --> 00:09:26,971
un ongeshribn "JUD."

155
00:09:28,665 --> 00:09:30,660
un opgeshnitn bay im der...

156
00:09:37,845 --> 00:09:42,090
der eyver opgeshnitn bay dem JUD.

157
00:09:42,621 --> 00:09:46,800
dos heyst, zey hobn gekhoyzekt; zey hobn im gemalt.

158
00:09:48,628 --> 00:09:51,389
an ander, doytsh hot gezogt,

159
00:09:51,987 --> 00:09:53,584
iber etlekhe teg,

160
00:09:54,113 --> 00:09:58,663
"m'hot im gemalt, m'hot im itster o gemalt azoy, er zol nit hobn keyn kinder."

161
00:09:59,985 --> 00:10:03,087
nu, er hot azoy oysgegangen. es iz, oyf dr'erd iz geve- -legn,

162
00:10:03,087 --> 00:10:04,839
gevezn shoyn a,

163
00:10:04,947 --> 00:10:07,337
a blote fun, fun, fun blut.

164
00:10:08,997 --> 00:10:10,661
mir iz nit gut gevorn.

165
00:10:11,983 --> 00:10:13,730
MELKONYAN zogt,

166
00:10:14,667 --> 00:10:16,061
"vos kukstu?"

167
00:10:16,978 --> 00:10:19,267
ikh bin gevorn azoy a baleymter.

168
00:10:19,594 --> 00:10:20,988
ot azoy shtey ikh.

169
00:10:21,788 --> 00:10:27,590
farshteyst? ikh hob zikh avekgeshtelt far im.

170
00:10:28,538 --> 00:10:30,260
nit er shteyt — ikh shtey.

171
00:10:31,137 --> 00:10:33,274
azoy hot zikh mir gedukht.

172
00:10:33,853 --> 00:10:36,327
er hot mir a tsi geton farn hant, avekgegangen.

173
00:10:37,431 --> 00:10:39,079
mir zaynen arayngegangen in blok.

174
00:10:40,182 --> 00:10:41,408
⟨kh'hob⟩ zikh gezetst

175
00:10:42,358 --> 00:10:45,050
oyf mayn, oyf mayn ort.

176
00:10:45,177 --> 00:10:46,841
ikh her shoyn nit vos me redt.

177
00:10:47,640 --> 00:10:51,590
eyner... dernokh dem a geshrey fun dem blokovn:

178
00:10:51,859 --> 00:10:57,110
"ZAVTRA NA RABOTU NE BUDUT GNAT' NASHI DVA BLOKA, PEREDAL,

179
00:10:57,411 --> 00:10:59,092
 WACHMANN PRISHЁL,

180
00:10:59,335 --> 00:11:01,657
A BUDUT," zogt er, "ZHIDOV ISKAT'."

181
00:11:02,052 --> 00:11:05,033
heyst dos, "morgn vet men undz nit traybn oyf arbet,"

182
00:11:05,308 --> 00:11:07,293
hot er oysgeshrien, der blokover.

183
00:11:07,519 --> 00:11:09,622
"m'vet zukhn

184
00:11:10,219 --> 00:11:14,510
ZHIDOV, yidn vet men zukhn morgn."

185
00:11:16,446 --> 00:11:19,444
es hot zikh afile derhert a freylekher geshrey.

186
00:11:20,226 --> 00:11:22,211
epes eynike hobn oysgeshrien hura.

187
00:11:23,196 --> 00:11:25,920
a freyd. a shvere arbet:

188
00:11:26,520 --> 00:11:28,016
me geyt in KAR'ER,

189
00:11:28,208 --> 00:11:32,770
me shlept a gantsn tog di shteyner, in kelt.

190
00:11:32,933 --> 00:11:35,374
un morgn nit geyn oyf arbet.

191
00:11:35,430 --> 00:11:37,972
vos iz zey a dayge? zol men zukhn ZHIDOV!

192
00:11:39,227 --> 00:11:42,090
nor ikh, ikh, a yid,

193
00:11:42,822 --> 00:11:45,448
ikh darf vartn oyf morgn oyfn toyt,

194
00:11:45,893 --> 00:11:48,114
in dem frost shteyn azoy o.

195
00:11:48,846 --> 00:11:51,270
ver veyst vos nokh vet men bay mir opshnaydn,

196
00:11:51,411 --> 00:11:54,729
kedey farn toyt nokh oysmutshen. gut az er vet mir shisn.

197
00:11:58,009 --> 00:12:00,930
ikh hob a nakht nit geshlofn.

198
00:12:02,835 --> 00:12:05,730
mir hot zikh getrakht vos du vilst:

199
00:12:07,189 --> 00:12:10,650
dos kumt on mayn FAMILY kumt on mir oyfn,

200
00:12:10,650 --> 00:12:14,770
oyfn kop, epes g- gor ⟨a⟩, gute zakhn

201
00:12:14,770 --> 00:12:16,329
vos di mame kormet mir.

202
00:12:16,403 --> 00:12:18,450
dos kumt mir on dos oyfn kop.

203
00:12:18,450 --> 00:12:21,746
dos kumt on un dos mit a mol klapt alts iber

204
00:12:21,870 --> 00:12:24,412
un es geyt arayn der yat mit dem toyt.

205
00:12:25,077 --> 00:12:27,141
ot azoy hob ikh durkhgeshlept

206
00:12:27,141 --> 00:12:28,631
di gantse nakht.

207
00:12:31,793 --> 00:12:34,760
un ikh hob alts eyns mekhanish,

208
00:12:34,760 --> 00:12:37,900
hot zikh bay mir ineveynik geredt, ineveynik,

209
00:12:37,900 --> 00:12:42,739
"SHMA YISROEL ADOYNOY ELOYHEYNU ADOYNOY EKHOD. BORUKH SHEYM KEVOYD MALKHUSOY..." a gantse nakht, ⟨her zikh ayn⟩.

210
00:12:43,590 --> 00:12:45,540
 i ikh trakht,

211
00:12:45,647 --> 00:12:47,733
i oto dos geyt mir on in kop,

212
00:12:47,790 --> 00:12:51,277
un azoy hot zikh bay mir getrakht bizl ikh hob derhert,

213
00:12:51,537 --> 00:12:55,314
eynike hobn zikh shoyn ongehoybn zetsn shoyn in der fri.

214
00:12:55,314 --> 00:12:57,520
afile bay der nakht, beys kh'hob geshlofn,

215
00:12:57,520 --> 00:12:59,827
zogt mir MELKONYAN, "MISHKA,

216
00:12:59,827 --> 00:13:01,722
CHTO TY KRUTISH'SYA?

217
00:13:01,847 --> 00:13:04,271
CHTO TY MNE SPAT' NE DAЁSH'?"

218
00:13:04,412 --> 00:13:07,630
heyst dos, "vos dreyst zikh? vos gistu mir nit shlofn?"

219
00:13:08,209 --> 00:13:11,180
farshteyst? gey dertseyl im a mayse, far vos ke-

220
00:13:11,180 --> 00:13:13,540
ken, shlof ikh nit a gantse nakht!

221
00:13:14,503 --> 00:13:16,280
⟨es⟩ iz dergangen der fartog

222
00:13:16,280 --> 00:13:18,497
un ikh hob derhert fun der vaytn

223
00:13:20,427 --> 00:13:22,429
a havkeray fun di hint,

224
00:13:23,397 --> 00:13:25,950
a vayte havkeray fun di hint.

225
00:13:26,350 --> 00:13:30,970
bay mir iz geven der ⟨S-⟩ der, der herekhts

226
00:13:30,970 --> 00:13:32,925
iz geven ongeshtrengt.

227
00:13:33,437 --> 00:13:35,304
hob ikh shoyn glaykh farshtanen

228
00:13:35,665 --> 00:13:37,580
az es geyen di banditn,

229
00:13:38,685 --> 00:13:40,586
es geyen di um⟨UNK⟩s,

230
00:13:40,879 --> 00:13:44,417
es geyt di merdershe folk,

231
00:13:44,811 --> 00:13:46,695
di hintishe folk.

232
00:13:47,089 --> 00:13:48,905
zey geyen mir hargenen.

233
00:13:50,717 --> 00:13:54,778
neenter, neenter. shoyn derhert dem havkeray oyfn hoyf.

234
00:13:55,341 --> 00:13:56,837
⟨zey zaynen⟩ avekgegangen

235
00:13:57,889 --> 00:14:00,710
tsum ershtn tsu dem blok fun TATARSKn,

236
00:14:01,264 --> 00:14:03,384
vayle dortn hot men gefunen dem yidn.

237
00:14:04,217 --> 00:14:05,730
vi hot men im gefunen?

238
00:14:07,255 --> 00:14:10,033
er iz a gemalter un zey zaynen gemalte.

239
00:14:11,187 --> 00:14:12,666
er iz a sheyner,

240
00:14:12,925 --> 00:14:16,108
nokh shener fun zey, nor zey zaynen oykhet shvartse.

241
00:14:16,722 --> 00:14:18,538
nor alemay er ken nit

242
00:14:19,742 --> 00:14:22,160
reydn oyf TATARSKe,

243
00:14:23,100 --> 00:14:26,519
hobn zey gegebn a donos. m'hot gegebn oyf im

244
00:14:27,353 --> 00:14:30,110
a, m'hot im farret.

245
00:14:30,171 --> 00:14:36,830
m'hot, m'hot avekgegangen, m'hot, m'hot derleygt, imetser fun di farreter. ⟨iz⟩ farreter a sakh lebn undz!

246
00:14:37,343 --> 00:14:40,410
eyner a farreter hot gegebn oyf im a zog

247
00:14:40,410 --> 00:14:43,125
az me zol im, a nem ton,

248
00:14:43,384 --> 00:14:46,200
a kuk ton. nu...

249
00:14:49,898 --> 00:14:52,744
er hot a ponem oyf zeyers nit gekent reydn.

250
00:14:54,758 --> 00:15:02,530
oder an anderer hot gekent zogn az er hot mit im in eyn polk geven un er hot, gesluzhet ⟨in eynem⟩. dokumentn iz bay undz nit geven, di, di papirn.

251
00:15:03,660 --> 00:15:05,315
 kurts geredt,

252
00:15:08,460 --> 00:15:11,069
s'iz gekumen a tsayt tsu undzer blok.

253
00:15:11,498 --> 00:15:13,264
hot zikh opgeefnt a tir.

254
00:15:13,287 --> 00:15:16,757
UNK der tever hot gehat tsvey tirn, iz eyn tir hot men opgeefnt

255
00:15:16,813 --> 00:15:18,326
un a geshrey geton:

256
00:15:18,855 --> 00:15:20,367
"VSEM VYKHODIT'

257
00:15:20,796 --> 00:15:21,887
PO ODNOMU

258
00:15:22,399 --> 00:15:24,080
S OPUSHCHENNYMI BRYUKAMI."

259
00:15:24,998 --> 00:15:26,561
"alemen aroysgeyn

260
00:15:27,327 --> 00:15:28,823
tsu eyntsikvayz,

261
00:15:29,217 --> 00:15:30,341
in eyn rey,

262
00:15:30,567 --> 00:15:32,248
mit aropgelozene hoyzn."

263
00:15:33,385 --> 00:15:37,040
un es shteyt a gantse komisye fun a man tsen,

264
00:15:38,650 --> 00:15:42,150
mitn iber- ibern- VO GLAVE, vi me zogt dos,

265
00:15:42,150 --> 00:15:44,904
mitn kop fun dem UNK, komendant,

266
00:15:46,260 --> 00:15:47,809
un mir darfn durkhgeyn,

267
00:15:47,809 --> 00:15:49,376
un tsum sof iz nokh

268
00:15:49,534 --> 00:15:52,498
shteyen tsvey SOBAKOVODn mit di hint.

269
00:15:56,318 --> 00:15:57,510
me geyt.

270
00:15:59,575 --> 00:16:01,830
yederer vil aroysgeyn vos frier;

271
00:16:02,055 --> 00:16:04,175
oyfn gas iz nokh BALANDA git men.

272
00:16:04,283 --> 00:16:05,441
vos gikher.

273
00:16:07,506 --> 00:16:11,398
mir hot a zog geton BUBUSHYAN un MELKONYAN, "POSHLI!"

274
00:16:11,488 --> 00:16:13,237
zog ikh, "KHODITE! IDU."

275
00:16:13,868 --> 00:16:17,675
ikh b- YA ZA NIMI NE POSHЁL. ikh bin nokh zey nit avekgegangen.

276
00:16:18,070 --> 00:16:19,802
ikh bin avekgegangen

277
00:16:20,685 --> 00:16:22,839
ergets azoy vi

278
00:16:23,267 --> 00:16:28,171
ikh hob ge- dertseylt vi frier bin ikh gegangen: nit der ershter un nit der letster —

279
00:16:28,633 --> 00:16:29,977
ergets in mitn.

280
00:16:30,945 --> 00:16:33,740
un ikh hob farshtanen, ikh muz zikh do rukn

281
00:16:33,780 --> 00:16:36,790
nit tsvishn di,

282
00:16:36,852 --> 00:16:38,798
di Azerbaydzhaner.

283
00:16:38,798 --> 00:16:41,993
tsvishn undz iz geven Gruziner, ARMYANer, Azerbaydzhaner.

284
00:16:42,505 --> 00:16:44,389
nit tsvishn di Azerbaydzhaner.

285
00:16:44,462 --> 00:16:47,990
Azerbaydzhaner zaynen gemalte.

286
00:16:48,462 --> 00:16:51,409
nor az ikh vel... nor zey hot men alemen opgeklibn.

287
00:16:52,157 --> 00:16:53,976
tsum sof iz geven rikhtik,

288
00:16:53,976 --> 00:16:57,540
vayle s'iz geven in yeder lager kimat, oyb s'zaynen nit keyn sakh,

289
00:16:57,540 --> 00:17:00,318
nemt men zey alemen P-, oyf, oyf durkhkukn.

290
00:17:01,253 --> 00:17:03,800
farshteyst?,

291
00:17:04,982 --> 00:17:08,047
mir hot opgegoltn, vayl s'iz nit geven Azerbaydzhaner lebn mir.

292
00:17:08,374 --> 00:17:10,190
ikh bin geven tsvishn di Gruziner.

293
00:17:12,087 --> 00:17:15,112
GRUZIN VPEREDI MENYA, a hoykher,

294
00:17:15,112 --> 00:17:18,175
iz er gegangen mit aropgelozene hoyzn bizl ETO,

295
00:17:18,175 --> 00:17:20,980
un er geyt shtolts. fun hintn oykhet,

296
00:17:20,980 --> 00:17:24,233
mit aropgelozene hoyzn, er geyt shtolts

297
00:17:24,233 --> 00:17:27,288
un vil bavayzn, "o! SMOTRITE NA MENYA,

298
00:17:27,288 --> 00:17:28,503
vos ikh hob!

299
00:17:28,503 --> 00:17:31,470
ikh bin nit keyn ZHID! ikh bin nit keyn yid!"

300
00:17:32,792 --> 00:17:34,102
un ikh gey.

301
00:17:34,328 --> 00:17:38,152
bay mir ineveynik veynt zikh shoyn. bay mir iz nito keyn trern.

302
00:17:38,783 --> 00:17:41,330
beys ikh gey oyfn toyt,

303
00:17:42,057 --> 00:17:43,418
farlir ikh

304
00:17:44,790 --> 00:17:46,589
dem shtamp tsum lebn.

305
00:17:47,963 --> 00:17:51,942
farshteyst? ikh ver gor epes azoy vi mir iz alts eyns,

306
00:17:51,942 --> 00:17:53,711
nor gikher zol dos durkhgeyn.

307
00:17:54,426 --> 00:17:56,895
un ikh farknipl shtark

308
00:17:56,895 --> 00:17:58,403
di shtrik oyf zikh.

309
00:17:58,712 --> 00:18:01,220
ikh farknipl oyf di hoyzn di shtrik.

310
00:18:01,513 --> 00:18:05,020
un ikh ruk zikh, ikh ruk zikh nokh zey. ikh ruk zikh ot azoy o.

311
00:18:05,020 --> 00:18:06,250
ikh gey nokh zey.

312
00:18:06,250 --> 00:18:11,670
un ikh dergey, shteyt oto do o, oto, fun dem, mir hot zikh gedukht az dortn iz avade hundert NEMTSes. azoy iz

313
00:18:11,670 --> 00:18:16,090
der sh-, der, dukht zikh, es, in di oygn heybt zikh oyfet,

314
00:18:16,090 --> 00:18:18,510
mit di kokardes shteyen zey, di Natsis,

315
00:18:18,510 --> 00:18:20,600
di banditn. iber deroyf aleyn

316
00:18:20,600 --> 00:18:25,042
zaynen zey geven shtolts iber zikh: zey zaynen ongeton shener fun alemen.

317
00:18:25,042 --> 00:18:27,370
ot azoy zaynen zey gesh-... ⟨,⟩ ikh gey,

318
00:18:27,370 --> 00:18:31,039
un ikh vil fananderkniplen, un es kniplt zikh bay mir nit fanander.

319
00:18:31,298 --> 00:18:33,620
un di hintershte geyen un me shtupt.

320
00:18:33,660 --> 00:18:35,810
un der NACHAL'NIK LAGERYA

321
00:18:35,810 --> 00:18:40,270
⟨zogt⟩, "ACH, DU SCHWEINEN, VERFLUCHTEN SCHWEINEN!"

322
00:18:40,270 --> 00:18:42,749
un git mir a shtikl poyk aher in tsure,

323
00:18:43,718 --> 00:18:46,091
 az bay mir iz gevorn a bayl oto do o.

324
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:49,669
un er heyst mir "links!"

325
00:18:50,232 --> 00:18:51,795
s'iz geven rekhts.

326
00:18:52,172 --> 00:18:54,776
links, links, un KOGO rekhts.

327
00:18:54,776 --> 00:18:56,840
mir hot er gezogt links,

328
00:18:57,268 --> 00:18:59,374
vayl ikh hob zikh nokh far deroyf

329
00:18:59,374 --> 00:19:00,950
umgekert oyf hintn

330
00:19:00,950 --> 00:19:02,898
un ikh hob a ⟨sheg-⟩ a geshrey geton,

331
00:19:03,107 --> 00:19:08,518
"MELKONYAN! TASHCHI KOTELOK; TUT," zog ikh, "DAYUT BALANDU NA DVORE!"

332
00:19:08,828 --> 00:19:10,256
mit a gelekhter.

333
00:19:12,118 --> 00:19:13,175
farshteyst?

334
00:19:13,941 --> 00:19:15,994
hot er dos glaykh oyfgekhapt,

335
00:19:16,017 --> 00:19:17,799
az ikh bin a DUMMKOPF.

336
00:19:18,430 --> 00:19:23,469
"UNK VERFLUCHTEN SCHWEINEN," zogt er, "RUSSISCH VERFLUCHTEN SCHWEINEN. DUMMKOPF!"

337
00:19:23,593 --> 00:19:28,042
I MENYA UDARIL I ⟨SKAZAL NA⟩ links. mayn freylekhkeyt hot zikh im oysgedukht...

338
00:19:28,099 --> 00:19:31,046
farshteyst? mayn UNK ikh ken nit oto fananderbindn.

339
00:19:32,436 --> 00:19:33,982
ikh gey opet ahin o.

340
00:19:34,450 --> 00:19:39,027
 MELKONYAN untergegangen. "vos hot dos oyf d- dir der komendant geshrien?"

341
00:19:39,810 --> 00:19:43,567
zog ikh, "ikh hob azoy gikh nit gekent fananderkniplen di hoyzn."

342
00:19:43,776 --> 00:19:46,537
makht er, "keseyder treft zikh mit dir epes!

343
00:19:46,915 --> 00:19:50,318
ikh hob dokh dir gerufn," zogt er, ""kum mit undz!"

344
00:19:50,530 --> 00:19:55,160
du host dokh gehert az m'hot gezogt az me zol dos frier⟨,⟩ tsugreytn.

345
00:19:56,348 --> 00:19:58,890
kum zikh," zogt er, "shteln on-o dortn gikh."

346
00:20:00,229 --> 00:20:04,850
zog ikh, "vos heyst gikh? avuhin? BALANDA?" ikh gib a kuk:

347
00:20:04,850 --> 00:20:07,006
ersht in mitn hoyf shteyt a tish.

348
00:20:08,312 --> 00:20:12,119
a tish shteyt in mitn hoyf ahin vayter, lebn TATARSKn blok.

349
00:20:13,695 --> 00:20:15,073
vos iz dos?

350
00:20:15,433 --> 00:20:17,340
ETO NAUCHNYM,

351
00:20:17,492 --> 00:20:20,530
mit a gelerntn metode

352
00:20:20,783 --> 00:20:23,170
z- zukhn shoyn yene yidn.

353
00:20:23,837 --> 00:20:26,025
es shteyen finf NEMTSes.

354
00:20:26,672 --> 00:20:29,231
tsvishn zey iz a lerer eyner,

355
00:20:29,760 --> 00:20:33,340
zeyerer, fun di hoykh-shuln geendikte,

356
00:20:33,422 --> 00:20:36,186
un studentn fir, un eyner fun zey,

357
00:20:36,186 --> 00:20:40,436
a gelernter, veysndik vos iz, ver, vi gefint men a yidn,

358
00:20:40,645 --> 00:20:42,748
un, ale darfn durkhgeyn,

359
00:20:43,092 --> 00:20:47,460
un er lernt zey vi ken men gefinen a yidn.

360
00:20:49,150 --> 00:20:53,683
iz dortn opgeklibn oykhet... ot do iz opgeklibn a man fuftsn,

361
00:20:54,212 --> 00:20:56,529
un dortn shteyt shoyn oykhet a kupke

362
00:20:56,529 --> 00:21:01,310
vos er hot, vos zey hobn opgeklibn. s'iz g- durkhgegangen der TATARSKer blok frier,

363
00:21:01,310 --> 00:21:02,460
hobn zey opgeklibn.

364
00:21:02,460 --> 00:21:07,000
un nokhn TATARSKn darfn mir geyn, in eyn rey, ot azoy, in, in,...

365
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:10,794
nu, hob ikh zikh shoyn glaykh geshtelt nokh MELKONYANen. ⟨s'iz⟩ shoyn durkhgegangen eyn blok.

366
00:21:10,868 --> 00:21:12,853
ikh gey, trakht ikh in zikh,

367
00:21:12,893 --> 00:21:17,040
"got mayner... SHMA YISROEL ADOYNOY ELOYHEYNU ADOYNOY EKHOD...

368
00:21:17,040 --> 00:21:20,150
helf mir do o, helf mir do shoyn aroysgeyn.

369
00:21:20,150 --> 00:21:23,298
ikh hob shoyn keyn koyekh nit durkhgeyn tsvey

370
00:21:23,710 --> 00:21:28,250
kontroln, tsvey durkhkukungen in eyn tsayt.

371
00:21:28,333 --> 00:21:30,287
shoyn nito keyn koyekh!

372
00:21:30,287 --> 00:21:31,970
di harts halt nit oys."

373
00:21:31,970 --> 00:21:34,850
ikh bin aroysgegangen, bay mir iz gevorn a kalter shveys.

374
00:21:34,850 --> 00:21:38,199
fun der durkhkukung, az ikh bin aroys iz a kalter shveys bay mir avek,

375
00:21:40,618 --> 00:21:42,198
az ikh bin aroys a lebediker,

376
00:21:42,559 --> 00:21:46,030
un do darf ikh zikh vayter shteln, vayter geyn.

377
00:21:46,272 --> 00:21:48,662
trakht ikh, "oyb zey gefinen do

378
00:21:50,372 --> 00:21:53,609
tsvishn nit keyn yidn yidn, UNK mir gevis..."

379
00:21:53,609 --> 00:21:57,015
es ligt oyfn tish bay im TSIRKULI...

380
00:21:57,139 --> 00:21:58,604
tsirklen, dos iz azelkhe,

381
00:21:58,604 --> 00:22:00,435
 veyst, oto dos o,

382
00:22:00,435 --> 00:22:02,890
 azoy vi GOTOVAL'Nes,

383
00:22:02,890 --> 00:22:04,845
ot, vos me mest.

384
00:22:05,003 --> 00:22:06,735
veyst dokh, vos, vos me mest...

385
00:22:06,977 --> 00:22:09,840
itster o, faran vos me mest oys di kop.

386
00:22:10,470 --> 00:22:14,635
itster o, dos, dernokh dem hob ikh shoyn derzen, genoy alts vos s'iz gelegn.

387
00:22:14,635 --> 00:22:18,040
un s'iz gelegn dortn afile oygn,

388
00:22:18,418 --> 00:22:22,160
ISKUSSTVENNe, fun, gemakhte oygn,

389
00:22:22,160 --> 00:22:25,500
oykhet gemakht, velkhe oygn...

390
00:22:26,265 --> 00:22:28,807
farshteyst ⟨tsi nit?...⟩ iz yidishe oygn.

391
00:22:30,012 --> 00:22:31,980
gey ikh, trakht ikh...

392
00:22:33,268 --> 00:22:38,460
ikh ze k-, keyn sakh nemt er nit aroys fun ⟨ineveynik⟩, nor vemen nemt er aroys,

393
00:22:38,460 --> 00:22:40,167
shtelt zikh opet di gantse rey.

394
00:22:40,167 --> 00:22:43,607
me vart biz vanen me kukt durkh dem mentshn DETAL'Ne.

395
00:22:47,562 --> 00:22:49,901
⟨i-⟩ ikh ruk zikh nokh MELKONA- -NYANen,

396
00:22:49,907 --> 00:22:51,571
fun hintn BUBUSHYAN.

397
00:22:52,337 --> 00:22:57,030
trakht ikh, "halevay zol ⟨M-⟩ zol er nemen MELKONYANen.

398
00:22:57,568 --> 00:23:00,346
MELKONYAN vet kumen fun komendature.

399
00:23:00,488 --> 00:23:02,406
er vet zikh umkern kerik."

400
00:23:02,817 --> 00:23:05,940
nor nokh im UNK hob ikh nokh nit bamerkt

401
00:23:05,940 --> 00:23:08,143
az me zol nemen glaykh tsveyen nokh a mol.

402
00:23:10,849 --> 00:23:14,100
MELKONYAN iz durkhgegangen,

403
00:23:16,806 --> 00:23:18,420
un mir hot er opgeshtelt...

404
00:23:18,662 --> 00:23:20,360
er hot gehaltn a shtekl

405
00:23:20,704 --> 00:23:22,318
un shtelt mir opet,

406
00:23:25,227 --> 00:23:28,200
un heyst mir shteln zikh ot do in zayt

407
00:23:28,298 --> 00:23:31,190
tish, I VPEREDI,

408
00:23:31,521 --> 00:23:33,523
fun fornt iz shoyn keyner nito.

409
00:23:34,137 --> 00:23:35,869
bay mir iz geblibn eyn,

410
00:23:37,022 --> 00:23:39,885
eyn trot, ikh zol blaybn lebn.

411
00:23:40,937 --> 00:23:42,888
hot er mir opgeshtelt tsum toyt,

412
00:23:44,143 --> 00:23:46,179
